  "display_title": "Stroking the Transfer Student",
  "description": "“Pretty person! I like you!” \n\nA 17-year-old dog-type who moved to Seoul from the countryside to find a new best friend, ‘Yuu’ meets ‘Robin’, a cat-type who is beautiful from head to toe, on the first day of school and makes a 100% straightforward confession. \n\nThe two part ways without even exchanging names due to the annoying ringing of the bell, knowing Robin’s pounding heart. Yuu follows her scent to meet her again and debuts as a student council worker… \n\nThe straightforward dog-type Yuu and the proud lover Robin’s crazy school life begins now! \n\n(source: Peanutoon, translated)",
